# Generated from branding/cygnus/tokens.json by tools/gen-cygnus.py. Do not edit.
# Cygnus 26.10 default keys for the [dev.sinty.desktop] group. This is the
# authoritative definition of the accent + theme defaults: post-install/
# 20-desktop.sh consumes it as assets/branding/singularity-theme/
# 99-ncz-cygnus.gschema.override, starts the installed
# 99-ncz-defaults.gschema.override from it, and appends its non-Cygnus
# defaults into the same group. A token change therefore flows through to
# the installed override with no hand-copied hex anywhere.
